# Enemy_Skeleton - the white skeleton with the red scarf and the bone club (Tools/Blender/enemies/models_enemies.py).
# Read: big skull turned a little to the right, dark sockets with hot red pupils, red scarf with a forked tail
# flying right, bone club held up on the left. Light top-left.
size 48 48
key
  O #2c2838  bone outline
  o #4e4a63  bone outline on the lit side
  X #2c2838  sockets, nose, rib gaps (same ink, never sel-out)
  D #6c6a85  bone deep shadow / sel-out
  S #a4a6bd  bone shadow
  B #dcdee8  bone: skull line=D
  C #dcdee8  bone: limbs, ribs, club (same colour, own region key for shading) line=D
  H #f7f6f0  bone highlight (warm)
  Q #4a0a16  scarf outline
  q #6a1222  scarf outline on the lit side
  r #8c1c2c  scarf shadow
  R #b8283a  scarf line=r
  L #e0485a  scarf light
  E #ff7a86  pupil glow

